※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4649

※ A parameter in the image is handed what is in the image: nothing can be
※ copied there while the program runs, so text worked out at run time is
※ refused.

fn named(s: str in ⎕static) → str in ⎕static:
    s

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    if named("a" ⧺ "b") = "ab": 0u6 else: 1u6
